# Narrator: the camp on the goat path round the Tsolenka watchtower (The Guide to the Temple,
# docs/story/side_quests.md; docs/voice/narrator.md). Every line here is unvoiced for now.

~ enter:amber_road_camp
| A shelf of rock above the goat path, out of the worst of the wind: a fire in a ring of stones, a low tent, and a sledge drawn up close to the warmth.
| [flag.amber_guide_beaten] The fire on the shelf is burning low. Nobody is making tea.
cooldown 30

~ examine:goat_camp_tent
| A low tent of good oiled hide, much mended. Inside, a bedroll for one, and a pack nobody else is allowed to touch.

~ examine:goat_camp_sledge
| A child's sledge, padded with every blanket the family owns. The bundle on it coughs, and doesn't wake.
